{"unit_id":"better-er__dsh-tool-autoexpand#feature-1","repo":"better-er/dsh-tool-autoexpand","commit":"1508e77e44daf165ab8355f38919ed693eee371b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH·工具结果自动展开的功能「工具卡片自动处理」：观察会话中新插入的工具调用卡片，并依当前档位展开新卡片；展开档还会处理页面现有卡片。切换到侧栏的展开或折叠档即可触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:306-316","src/client/index.tsx:341-365","src/client/index.tsx:544-553"]}
